Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying roads drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.22,0:00:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, thus, a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high\NHail a brand new dawn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky Time to journey on On
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:00:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mark. Come above a\Nthing. We're on Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.18,0:00:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,a legendary
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:00:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath,\Nthen we'll make some waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.94,0:01:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We run our daunted. Ain't no\Nbeginners. Cause if you're wanted, then
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.68,0:01:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,you're a winner For we are on the\Ncruise And freedom is the only rule
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.82,0:01:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day\NCause that's just our way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece. I'll be the first. I'll\Nput it be so bad. I'll be the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.52,0:01:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real. It must be cause my
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,hand's on the wheel I'm done playing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.48,0:01:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Filled with the waiting. In a world\NI'm feeling alive, but I'll be loud
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.60,0:01:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.48,0:01:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward\NDreaming from the very first day,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.54,0:02:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd make my name And don't you\Nknow that dream hasn't changed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.96,0:02:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a wave in the air The world\NI'm feeling alive, look out below
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.64,0:02:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.12,0:02:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.74,0:02:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have any\Nbones And I am only bones
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's interesting. I wonder if\Nit enjoys making no skull jokes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.52,0:02:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I doubt it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.98,0:02:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're a pretty good artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.76,0:02:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to capture the moment on paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.40,0:02:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Drive pictures? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.56,0:02:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.82,0:02:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a plan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Problem is, there's not\Nmuch we can do underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.74,0:02:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.94,0:02:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem is, the thing's gigantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.28,0:03:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn't even take\Nit on above sea level.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.22,0:03:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody in their right mind would\Nhave run for the hills by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.34,0:03:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's taking them so long\Nto decide? We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.28,0:03:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Shift the helm due south.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.60,0:03:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.72,0:03:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go straight towards it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.34,0:03:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid! That thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.38,0:03:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.82,0:03:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You held it in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.14,0:03:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.40,0:03:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We made him all better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.90,0:03:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it helps that\NNami put on a coat, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.38,0:03:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not safe on this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.18,0:03:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to protect myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.34,0:03:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's coming up behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.52,0:03:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.60,0:03:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm so happy you came back for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.86,0:03:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best crew a\Ncaptain could ask for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.96,0:03:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's rush in there and rescue my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.60,0:03:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.64,0:04:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It destroyed the coating!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.92,0:04:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That ship's bigger than the Sonny!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.40,0:04:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Like jellyfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.50,0:04:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.28,0:04:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.68,0:04:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they're cute! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.60,0:04:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do that, you'll\Nbreak the bubble for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.14,0:04:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Chicken voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we escape somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.44,0:04:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, let me take care of it. Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.34,0:04:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If you pop the bubble, then we all die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.78,0:04:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The little fellow's right, but if you\Nwant to face the crack of that badly,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I might just have the idea for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.24,0:04:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There! Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.26,0:05:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That contraption is called\Nthe flutter kick coating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.26,0:05:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an extravehicular diving suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.98,0:05:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If I let them call the shots, we'll\Nall go to hell in a handbasket.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.12,0:05:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you weren't supposed to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.26,0:05:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of us wanted to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.78,0:05:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they're going to stay\Nand try to fight that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.40,0:05:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been telling you all to\Nrun away from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But your fearless leader\Nwas having none of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.30,0:05:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you rather have to fight it outside\Nor fight it right here on the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.08,0:05:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.99,0:05:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys get out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.00,0:05:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Far, far away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This rope's kind of annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.52,0:05:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember to stay as far\Nfrom the ship as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.72,0:05:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.76,0:05:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.12,0:05:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys forgot the safety ropes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.54,0:05:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get separated!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.14,0:05:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like Nami's worried about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.06,0:05:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I need both of you guys to distract him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.70,0:05:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can get one good punch\Noff, I think I can take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.18,0:05:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't I just slice him to pieces?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.02,0:05:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that wouldn't do me any good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.10,0:05:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to capture him\Nand keep him as a pet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.28,0:06:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that was way too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.62,0:06:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.86,0:06:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Rocket Launcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.42,0:06:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That was incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.38,0:06:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Not another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He lost his account!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Guard point!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he hit the ship pretty hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.12,0:06:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.00,0:06:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.02,0:06:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.58,0:06:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to be crushed\Nagainst that mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.76,0:06:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, feel true!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.72,0:06:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Pigantesco Moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.34,0:06:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, those hands are big!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.68,0:06:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.98,0:07:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I was only in the water for the\Nbriefest moment, so my power held out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, third gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.66,0:07:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Armament Hartnick!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.10,0:07:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So tough! Underwater! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.04,0:07:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh crap! It doesn't look like that octopus\Nis gonna wait patiently. Blue walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.74,0:07:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my Sanji just left his\Nbubble he's fast even in
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,the sea like a fish man\Nso cool I spent two years
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,running from those monsters\Non that island and the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.56,0:07:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,first thing I do is run\Nstraight at another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.96,0:07:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But all things considered,\Nthis one's a bit cuter, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Diable Jomber!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.84,0:08:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.08,0:08:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.66,0:08:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Crossing the six paths!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.16,0:08:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, yeah, I couldn't\Neven see his attack, hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.74,0:08:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He blew it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.02,0:08:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of training\Ndid Luffy go through?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.50,0:09:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.78,0:09:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.78,0:09:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why is that shark wearing a shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.38,0:09:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention it's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.08,0:09:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.14,0:09:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea current is pulling us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.74,0:09:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being swept away\Nby the downward current.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.40,0:09:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't get split up down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.82,0:09:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow them. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.88,0:09:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.72,0:09:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dark and wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.90,0:09:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you fools?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.95,0:09:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That dude was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.87,0:09:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Panicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.78,0:09:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had a stomach, I would be\Nfighting against conscience right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it your quibble, Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.46,0:09:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn hard to port, otherwise\Nwe're going to crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.06,0:09:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:10:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let up for a second\Nor the ship's on her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.40,0:10:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep it together, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.84,0:10:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay in the center of the current!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.62,0:10:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's way too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.78,0:10:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awake. Ah, what a headache, but at
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.32,0:10:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,least we made it what's\Nwrong why are you all
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.10,0:10:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,making such long faces i mean i'm awake
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,now so there's nothing for you to fear man
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.62,0:10:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,is it freezing luffy zoro and sanji have\Ngone missing they're lost in the sea what
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The most we can do now is hope the monster\Ndidn't tear them apart. Glad you're being
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,optimistic how are we supposed to find\Nthem when we can't even see what's in front
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:11:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,of us i don't like being in the dark it\Nfeels like something could attack us from
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.58,0:11:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,any direction the best i can guess is\Nwe've descended about 7 000 meters even the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.54,0:11:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,shark submerged can't\Nsustain this level of
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,pressure how close are\Nwe to fishman island
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.60,0:11:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe the others have already\Nmade it there probably
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.94,0:11:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Not according to Kuma, it's\N10,000 meters below sea level.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.16,0:11:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And we have three thousand\Nmore to go. Those guys each
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.52,0:11:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,have a bubble and that's all\Neven if they are somehow still
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.86,0:11:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,alive they'll need more\Nair none of this would have
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.02,0:11:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,happened if they used the\Nsafety ropes freaking out's not
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.94,0:11:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,helping so let's get to work\Nwe can look for him with my
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.48,0:11:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,new searchlight does it shine\Nfrom your eyes you'll see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.32,0:11:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cranky? Nipple legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.38,0:11:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do they have to be there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.74,0:11:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Zoro! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.32,0:12:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where in the world have you guys gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.74,0:12:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you all fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out, come out, wherever you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.42,0:12:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is so fast, and we're so far\Ndown, Sunny's eyes are practically useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.12,0:12:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We can barely see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.96,0:12:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no wonder that everyone's on edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.34,0:12:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a better\Nway to tackle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.96,0:12:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You ladies got any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep searching and just hope for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.96,0:12:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't stop the ship right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.18,0:12:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, a jellyfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.90,0:12:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like we're inside it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.60,0:12:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like it could swallow us whole!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're twinkling!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.20,0:12:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a starry sky wherever they go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.28,0:12:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.88,0:12:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's one long tentacle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.28,0:13:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You, uh, want to shake\Nhands and be friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.90,0:13:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, don't touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.72,0:13:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably venomous!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.68,0:13:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.14,0:13:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.38,0:13:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Coup de Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.96,0:13:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.88,0:13:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It ain't that big jellyfish hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.50,0:13:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, not to mention we lost\Nsome air in that maneuver.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.18,0:13:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It was better than the alternative.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.42,0:13:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But yeah, the coup de burst sucks\Nin air to make a quick launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.24,0:13:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing is, because we're underwater,\Nit's only resources our air supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.26,0:13:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So obviously, when we use\Nit, our bubble shrinks a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The fish that attacked\Nit turned upside down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.94,0:13:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A neurotoxin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.98,0:13:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.38,0:13:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's awful down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.22,0:13:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.74,0:13:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.98,0:13:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All these creepy creatures\Nwith their freaky eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.44,0:14:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the sea is so dark,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.50,0:14:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,many of the animals that live\Ndown here have poor eyesight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,However there were some that\Nhave very developed eyes as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.34,0:14:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh you're curious as to how I can see when
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.92,0:14:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have eyes it's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,a secret hey Brooke?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.32,0:14:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it you're always\Ntalking to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.82,0:14:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a habit that comes\Nfrom being lonely. Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit fooling around!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.32,0:14:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No more violence, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.40,0:14:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Zoro! City!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.76,0:14:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami is scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.12,0:14:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.22,0:14:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.52,0:14:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:14:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:14:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.41,0:15:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Have any of you seen the\Npirate who boarded the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.54,0:15:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.45,0:15:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.78,0:15:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.94,0:15:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But where is somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.54,0:15:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen him for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.22,0:15:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Not since we descended.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.74,0:15:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think he might have been\Nthrown off when everything went crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.92,0:15:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Totally possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.14,0:15:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, his arms and legs were tied up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.08,0:15:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he could hold on to\Nanything while we were rocking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.08,0:15:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally, I'd agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.18,0:15:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But it seems that he freed himself. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.58,0:15:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,so that Drop weirdo escaped and he's still
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.14,0:15:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,here he's got to be\Nwaiting us out for a moment
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.64,0:15:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,to attack this is bad\Nif you're so eager to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.70,0:15:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,see me i'd be happy to\Nsneak into your room
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,tonight sweetheart damn\Nit we've got enough
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.02,0:15:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,problems we don't need\Nthis guy giving us one
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.94,0:15:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,more thing to worry\Nabout don't get worked up
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.66,0:15:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,it's not like he's an\Nactual threat to any of us
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.04,0:15:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, you think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:16:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see how wrong you are now\Nthat the three morons who could
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,put up a fight have gotten themselves\Nkilled fighting that kraken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.94,0:16:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.04,0:16:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way they survive\Ngetting sucked down into the bowels
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.04,0:16:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,of the ocean with just those\Ntiny bubbles to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.08,0:16:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shame I didn't have the chance\Nto kill Straw Hat with my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.44,0:16:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But no one will ever doubt that\Nhe's dead once I come back with
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.16,0:16:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the rest of his crew members heads\Nin tow as my personal trophies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.92,0:16:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No one at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.68,0:16:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't get too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.94,0:16:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.66,0:16:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If I killed them all now, there wouldn't\Nbe anyone left to sail the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.58,0:16:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And then what would I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.30,0:16:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll let them live for now while\Nthey can still be useful to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.86,0:16:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we land on Fishman Island though, I'm\Ngonna slaughter you down to the last man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see a break out of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.04,0:17:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he even manage to\Nget in there? Because we
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.34,0:17:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,weren't paying attention to\Nhim if he weren't so stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.18,0:17:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We could have been in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.56,0:17:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,His body was like a big\Nmass of goo in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.30,0:17:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't have a real shape\NSo he was like a pile of mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.10,0:17:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if I had to guess\Nthe Devil Fruit power
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.00,0:17:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Most likely a logia type fruit at\Nthat he was giving us a false sense
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.20,0:17:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,of security because he could have\Nescaped at any time Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.30,0:17:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll behave, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.78,0:17:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You and the banana hammock, and if\Nyou let me out, I'll be your servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.72,0:17:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You feeling all right, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.82,0:17:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.14,0:17:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It just got really hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:17:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.32,0:18:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.20,0:18:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Chouchou!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.11,0:18:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It is warmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.08,0:18:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second. Is that smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.32,0:18:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't see what's in\Nfront of us through that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.48,0:18:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoke under the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.38,0:18:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, it can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.40,0:18:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.94,0:18:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hydro-thermal deposits.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.37,0:18:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.29,0:18:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a volcanic area. For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.08,0:18:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see where there\Nhave been eruptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.32,0:18:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.26,0:18:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If one of those erupts,\Nwe're just gonna stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.28,0:18:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.20,0:18:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.78,0:18:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something coming after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.78,0:18:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's carnivorous tube worms!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.68,0:18:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got no choice. Small one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.26,0:18:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Coup de Course!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.14,0:18:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Chase those crabs!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.42,0:18:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Have to risk it again. Coup de burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.98,0:19:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know what\Nthe hell those things are!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.54,0:19:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.58,0:19:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Coup de burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.40,0:19:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.52,0:19:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.20,0:19:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way the others can\Nsurvive down here on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.52,0:19:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this is happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.06,0:19:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'd only just gotten back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.26,0:19:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.17,0:19:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Those three are way too tough to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.38,0:19:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Even using coup to burst that sparingly,\Nwe've lost so much air already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.34,0:19:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.54,0:19:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A light in the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.24,0:19:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.28,0:19:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Fishman Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.96,0:19:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Luffy beat us there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.30,0:19:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.68,0:19:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't descended\Nthe last 3,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.04,0:19:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.12,0:19:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.56,0:19:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.50,0:19:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to flash signals,\Ndo it without actually flashing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.50,0:19:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.90,0:19:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's still too bright to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.08,0:19:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.54,0:20:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,An anglerfish! We're screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.48,0:20:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The deep-sea hunter fooled us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.34,0:20:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hook, line, and sink her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.90,0:20:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A little close that time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.78,0:20:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't anywhere left for us to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.98,0:20:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.88,0:20:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.04,0:20:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's human?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.46,0:20:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this isn't making a sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.42,0:20:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A sea monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's taking the form of a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.64,0:20:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a sea monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to capsize the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.94,0:20:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.20,0:20:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's naughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.94,0:20:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You know better, Ancaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.58,0:20:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not allowed to eat ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.96,0:20:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.68,0:20:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Vandor Deccan won't be\Nhappy when he hears about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.80,0:21:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, did he just help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.12,0:21:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who freaking cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.64,0:21:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just make a break for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.16,0:21:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He might change his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead men tell no tales,\Nand dead men have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.50,0:21:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I pluck the rings right off their\Nhands within these shadowy seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.50,0:21:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead men have no regrets\Nand no tears left to weep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.08,0:21:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pluck the crowns right off their\Nheads within this cold, black deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.84,0:21:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sunken treasures free\Nfor the taking. A king
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.10,0:21:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,of pirates in the making\NI leave my enemies
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.76,0:21:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Weeping and shaking, Vander Decken is my
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.04,0:21:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,name And these long-lost riches I do claim
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.50,0:21:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.26,0:22:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.78,0:22:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a ghost ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.28,0:22:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the last one who should be scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.98,0:22:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing would make me happier,\Nbut take a look at their sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.48,0:22:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the legendary Flying Dutchman!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.82,0:22:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.44,0:22:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.90,0:22:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,As the story goes, it sailed\Nthe seas hundreds of years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.76,0:22:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One dark and stormy night, the captain\Nof the ship suddenly lost his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.90,0:22:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Consumed with madness, he threw his own\Ncrewmates into the sea one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.88,0:22:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he turned his gaze to the\Nheavens and cursed the very gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.94,0:22:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain's name was none\Nother than Vander Decken,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.04,0:22:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and the ship was the Flying Dutchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.98,0:22:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The gods condemned him for his actions,\Nand he was cursed for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.68,0:22:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sailing the seas aimlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.36,0:22:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Theron and Mary Vassal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.16,0:23:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you're a skeleton who has sailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.52,0:23:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,On a ghost ship of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.76,0:23:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The sight of the flying Dutchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Will put chills down your spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.30,0:23:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.40,0:23:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not digging their\Ntreasure out of your stomachs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.32,0:23:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So no eating the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.62,0:23:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give it a good knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.42,0:23:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.46,0:23:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we're about to get pounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.72,0:23:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well sure, he's our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.56,0:23:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, we need a coup de purse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.72,0:23:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.14,0:23:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We used up all our fuel already.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.34,0:23:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That means we're on our own till\NI can restock the cola supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.94,0:23:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the monster of\Nthe Arctic, the Kraken.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.28,0:23:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You big boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.36,0:23:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, he learned his lesson. Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.56,0:24:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.34,0:24:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.52,0:24:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, I thought you were dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.10,0:24:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That was so scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.14,0:24:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.08,0:24:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy Swan! Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.68,0:24:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It was crazy, that's for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.82,0:24:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They got lost. Morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.88,0:24:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They're hopeless without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.64,0:24:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna take that, Watasumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.74,0:24:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.16,0:24:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Avenge yourself! Start swinging!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.14,0:24:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My bubble popped and so did Sanji,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.66,0:24:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,so we all had to crowd inside\NZoro's before he drowned!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.16,0:24:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're running out of air!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.88,0:24:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you stop scaring us like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.48,0:24:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now a song for you, captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.14,0:24:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.46,0:25:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,kidding,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.20,0:25:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and you tamed the kraken\Njust like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.74,0:25:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.34,0:25:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So is he going to be our new guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.18,0:25:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.09,0:25:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If that Cape dude can have\Na sea monster pull his ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.64,0:25:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,then we can have Tsurume pull the Sunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.50,0:25:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.41,0:25:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you would name\Nit already, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.52,0:25:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cool if he wants\Nto give us a free ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.22,0:25:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But make sure he doesn't crush\Nus with those giant tentacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.98,0:25:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.50,0:25:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.06,0:25:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta turn back or we're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.12,0:25:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.46,0:25:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,An undersea volcano.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.04,0:25:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight ahead!
